-- ⛔⛔⛔ `pm.layer` DIRECTLY, AND NOT `layers/every_layer.sqlc`, WHICH IS THE WHOLE POINT OF THIS
--    LINE. This is a MEMBERSHIP test: does the layer this reference names exist. That relation is
